      "content": "wait, u think the guy with the strict diet and big community gatherings is more unpredictable? i'm confused. usually people in tight-knit communities are more stable because they have more accountability. why would \"rigid\" translate to \"volatile\" in an actuarial sense? isn't the guy living alone in a city more of a wild card?",
